    "Are you sure you want to unenroll from the verified {certNameLong}  track of {courseName}  ({courseNumber})?": "Biztosan ki szeretne iratkozni a {courseName} ({courseNumber}) tanfolyam ellen\u0151rz\u00f6tt {certNameLong} s\u00e1vj\u00e1b\u00f3l?",
