    "Thank you for submitting your financial assistance application for {course_name}! You can expect a response in 2-4 business days.": "K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck, hogy beny\u00fajtotta p\u00e9nz\u00fcgyi t\u00e1mogat\u00e1si alkalmaz\u00e1s\u00e1t a(z) {course_name} kurzusra! V\u00e1laszra 2-4 munkanapon bel\u00fcl sz\u00e1m\u00edthat.",
    "Thank you for submitting your photos. We will review them shortly. You can now sign up for any %(platformName)s course that offers verified certificates. Verification is good for one year. After one year, you must submit photos for verification again.": "K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck, hogy bek\u00fcldte a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9peit. Hamarosan \u00e1tn\u00e9zz\u00fck \u0151ket. Most m\u00e1r feliratkozhat b\u00e1rmelyik %(platformName)s tanfolyamra, amely hiteles\u00edtett bizony\u00edtv\u00e1nyokat k\u00edn\u00e1l. A hiteles\u00edt\u00e9s egy \u00e9vig \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes. Egy \u00e9v eltelt\u00e9vel \u00fajra be kell ny\u00fajtania a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9peket a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9shez.",
    "Thanks for returning to verify your ID in: {courseName}": "K\u00f6sz\u00f6nj\u00fck, hogy visszat\u00e9rt az azonos\u00edt\u00f3ja ellen\u0151rz\u00e9s\u00e9hez a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 kurzusban: {courseName}",
    "The URL you entered seems to be an email address. Do you want to add the required mailto: prefix?": "Az az internetc\u00edm, amit beg\u00e9pelt\u00e9l e-mail c\u00edmnek t\u0171nik. Hozz\u00e1 akarod adni a sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges mailto: prefixumot?",
    "The URL you entered seems to be an external link. Do you want to add the required http:// prefix?": "Az az internetc\u00edm, amit beg\u00e9pelt\u00e9l k\u00fcls\u0151 kapcsolatnak t\u0171nik. Hozz\u00e1 akarod adni a sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges http:// prefixumot?",
    "The assignment type must have a name.": "A feladatt\u00edpusnak nevet kell adni.",
    "The certificate available date must be later than the course end date.": "A bizony\u00edtv\u00e1ny el\u00e9rhet\u0151s\u00e9gi d\u00e1tum\u00e1nak k\u00e9s\u0151bbinek kell lennie, mint a tanfolyam befejez\u00e9si d\u00e1tuma.",
    "The certificate display behavior must be one of: {behavior_options}": "A bizony\u00edtv\u00e1ny megjelen\u00edt\u00e9si m\u00f3dj\u00e1nak a k\u00f6vetkez\u0151k egyik\u00e9nek kell lennie: {behavior_options}",
    "The certificate for this learner has been re-validated and the system is re-running the grade for this learner.": "A rendszer \u00fajra \u00e9rv\u00e9nyes\u00edtette a tanul\u00f3 bizony\u00edtv\u00e1ny\u00e1t, \u00e9s \u00fajra futtatja a tanul\u00f3 oszt\u00e1lyzat\u00e1t.",
    "The certificates display behavior must be {valid_option} if certificate available date is set.": "A bizony\u00edtv\u00e1nyok megjelen\u00edt\u00e9si viselked\u00e9s\u00e9nek {valid_option} kell lennie, ha a bizony\u00edtv\u00e1ny el\u00e9rhet\u0151s\u00e9gi d\u00e1tuma be van \u00e1ll\u00edtva.",
    "The cohort cannot be added": "Tanul\u00f3csoport hozz\u00e1ad\u00e1sa sikertelen",
    "The cohort cannot be saved": "A tanul\u00f3csoportot nem lehet menteni",
    "The combined length of the organization and library code fields cannot be more than <%- limit %> characters.": "A szervezet \u00e9s k\u00f6nyvt\u00e1r azonos\u00edt\u00f3 mez\u0151k \u00f6sszes\u00edtett bet\u0171sz\u00e1ma nem lehet t\u00f6bb, mint <%- limit %> karakterek.",
    "The combined length of the organization, course number, and course run fields cannot be more than <%- limit %> characters.": "A szervezet, a kurzussz\u00e1m \u00e9s a kurzusid\u0151 mez\u0151k \u00f6sszes\u00edtett bet\u0171sz\u00e1ma nem lehet t\u00f6bb, mint <%- limit %> karakterek.",
    "The country that team members primarily identify with.": "A csapat tagjai \u00e1ltal els\u0151dlegesen azonos\u00edtott orsz\u00e1g.",
    "The course end date must be later than the course start date.": "A kurzus v\u00e9g\u00e9nek k\u00e9s\u0151bbinek kell lennie, mint a kezdet\u00e9nek.",
    "The course must have an assigned start date.": "A kurzushoz hozz\u00e1 kell rendelni a kezd\u00e9s d\u00e1tum\u00e1t.",
    "The course start date must be later than the enrollment start date.": "A kurzus kezd\u00e9s d\u00e1tum\u00e1nak k\u00e9s\u0151bbinek kell lennie, mint a feliratkoz\u00e1s d\u00e1tum\u00e1nak.",
    "The email address you've provided isn't formatted correctly.": "Az \u00d6n \u00e1ltal megadott e-mail-c\u00edm form\u00e1tuma nem megfelel\u0151.",
    "The enrollment end date cannot be after the course end date.": "A feliratkoz\u00e1s befejez\u0151 d\u00e1tuma nem lehet k\u00e9s\u0151bbi, mint a kurzus befejez\u0151 d\u00e1tuma.",
    "The enrollment start date cannot be after the enrollment end date.": "A feliratkoz\u00e1s d\u00e1tuma nem lehet k\u00e9s\u0151bbi, mint a befejez\u0151 d\u00e1tum.",
    "The file could not be uploaded.": "A f\u00e1jlt nem siker\u00fclt felt\u00f6lteni.",
    "The file must be at least {size} in size.": "A f\u00e1jl m\u00e9rete legal\u00e1bb {size} kell legyen",
    "The file must be smaller than {size} in size.": "A f\u00e1jl m\u00e9rete kisebb kell legyen, mint {size}.",
    "The following email addresses and/or usernames are invalid:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 email c\u00edmek \u00e9s/vagy felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3nevek \u00e9rv\u00e9nytelenek:",
    "The following errors were generated:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 hib\u00e1k keletkeztek:",
