    "The following information is already a part of your {platform} profile and is required for your application. To edit this information go to ": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k m\u00e1r a(z) {platform} profilod r\u00e9sz\u00e9t k\u00e9pezik, \u00e9s sz\u00fcks\u00e9gesek az alkalmaz\u00e1sodhoz. Az inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k szerkeszt\u00e9s\u00e9hez menj a ",
    "The following message will be displayed at the bottom of the courseware pages within your course:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 \u00fczenet jelenik meg a tananyag oldalainak alj\u00e1n a kurzusodban:",
    "The following options are available for the {license_name} license.": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 lehet\u0151s\u00e9gek \u00e1llnak rendelkez\u00e9sre a {license_name} licenchez.",
    "The following required files could not be added to the course:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges f\u00e1jlokat nem siker\u00fclt hozz\u00e1adni a kurzushoz:",
    "The following required files were imported to this course:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges f\u00e1jlok lettek import\u00e1lva ebbe a kurzusba:",
    "The following users are no longer enrolled in the course:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 hallgat\u00f3k m\u00e1r nincsenek feliratkozva:",
    "The following warnings were generated:": "A k\u00f6vetkez\u0151 figyelmeztet\u00e9s keletkezett:",
    "The general category for this type of assignment, for example, Homework or Midterm Exam. This name is visible to learners.": "Az ilyen t\u00edpus\u00fa feladat \u00e1ltal\u00e1nos kateg\u00f3ri\u00e1ja, p\u00e9ld\u00e1ul H\u00e1zi feladat vagy F\u00e9l\u00e9vi vizsga. Ez a n\u00e9v l\u00e1that\u00f3 a tanul\u00f3k sz\u00e1m\u00e1ra.",
    "The grading process is still running. Refresh the page to see updates.": "Az oszt\u00e1lyoz\u00f3 elj\u00e1r\u00e1s m\u00e9g mindig fut. Friss\u00edtsd az oldalt az \u00fajabb inform\u00e1ci\u00f3k\u00e9rt.",
    "The language that team members primarily use to communicate with each other.": "A nyelv, amelyet a csapattagok els\u0151sorban a kommunik\u00e1ci\u00f3hoz haszn\u00e1lnak egym\u00e1s k\u00f6z\u00f6tt.",
    "The minimum completion percentage must be a whole number between 0 and 100.": "A minim\u00e1lis teljes\u00edt\u00e9si sz\u00e1zal\u00e9knak 0 \u00e9s 100 k\u00f6z\u00f6tti eg\u00e9sz sz\u00e1mnak kell lennie.",
    "The minimum grade for course credit is not set.": "Nincs minimum oszt\u00e1lyzat be\u00e1ll\u00edtva a kurzus kredithez.",
