    "Warnings": "Figyelmeztet\u00e9sek",
    "We ask you to activate your account to ensure it is really you creating the account and to prevent fraud.": "K\u00e9rj\u00fck, aktiv\u00e1lja fi\u00f3kj\u00e1t, hogy megbizonyosodjunk arr\u00f3l, val\u00f3ban \u00d6n hozza l\u00e9tre a fi\u00f3kot, \u00e9s megel\u0151zz\u00fck a csal\u00e1sokat.",
    "We couldn't create your account.": "Nem siker\u00fclt l\u00e9trehozni a fi\u00f3kot.",
    "We couldn't find any results for \"%s\".": "Nem tal\u00e1ltunk eredm\u00e9nyt a(z) \u201e%s\u201d kifejez\u00e9sre.",
    "We couldn't sign you in.": "Nem tudjuk bejelentkeztetni.",
    "We have encountered an error. Refresh your browser and then try again.": "Hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt. Friss\u00edtsd a b\u00f6ng\u00e9sz\u0151t \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1ld \u00fajra.",
    "We have received your information and are verifying your identity. You will see a message on your dashboard when the verification process is complete (usually within 5-7 days). In the meantime, you can still access all available course content.": "Megkaptuk az adatait, \u00e9s \u00e9ppen ellen\u0151rizz\u00fck a szem\u00e9lyazonoss\u00e1g\u00e1t. \u00c9rtes\u00edt\u00e9st kap az ir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3pultj\u00e1n, amikor a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9si folyamat befejez\u0151dik (\u00e1ltal\u00e1ban 5-7 napon bel\u00fcl). Addig is hozz\u00e1f\u00e9rhet az \u00f6sszes el\u00e9rhet\u0151 tananyaghoz.",
    "We just need a little more information before you start learning with %(platformName)s.": "Egy kicsivel t\u00f6bb inform\u00e1ci\u00f3ra van sz\u00fcks\u00e9g\u00fcnk, miel\u0151tt elkezdesz tanulni a %(platformName)s rendszerrel.",
    "We securely encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "Biztons\u00e1gosan titkos\u00edtjuk a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9pedet, \u00e9s elk\u00fcldj\u00fck a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9si szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sunknak fel\u00fclvizsg\u00e1latra. A f\u00e9nyk\u00e9ped \u00e9s az adataid a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9si folyamat befejez\u00e9se ut\u00e1n nem ker\u00fclnek ment\u00e9sre vagy nem lesznek l\u00e1that\u00f3ak a %(platformName)s fel\u00fclet\u00e9n.",
    "We use the highest levels of security available to encrypt your photo and send it to our authorization service for review. Your photo and information are not saved or visible anywhere on %(platformName)s after the verification process is complete.": "A legmagasabb szint\u0171 biztons\u00e1gi int\u00e9zked\u00e9seket alkalmazzuk a f\u00e9nyk\u00e9ped titkos\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1ra, majd elk\u00fcldj\u00fck a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9si szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1sunknak fel\u00fclvizsg\u00e1latra. A f\u00e9nyk\u00e9ped \u00e9s az adataid a hiteles\u00edt\u00e9si folyamat befejez\u00e9se ut\u00e1n nem ker\u00fclnek ment\u00e9sre vagy megjelen\u00edt\u00e9sre a %(platformName)s fel\u00fclet\u00e9n.",
    "We use your verification photos to confirm your identity and ensure the validity of your certificate.": "Az ellen\u0151rz\u0151 f\u00e9nyk\u00e9peket az \u00d6n szem\u00e9lyazonoss\u00e1g\u00e1nak meger\u0151s\u00edt\u00e9s\u00e9re \u00e9s a bizony\u00edtv\u00e1ny \u00e9rv\u00e9nyess\u00e9g\u00e9nek biztos\u00edt\u00e1s\u00e1ra haszn\u00e1ljuk.",
    "We're sorry to see you go! Your account will be deleted shortly.": "Sajn\u00e1ljuk, hogy elm\u00e9sz! A fi\u00f3kod hamarosan t\u00f6rl\u00e9sre ker\u00fcl.",
    "We're sorry, there was an error": "Sajn\u00e1ljuk, hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt.",
    "We've encountered an error. Refresh your browser and then try again.": "Hiba t\u00f6rt\u00e9nt. Friss\u00edtsd a b\u00f6ng\u00e9sz\u0151t, \u00e9s pr\u00f3b\u00e1ld \u00fajra.",
